  "id": "7fd0bbeec2d738b1a31d8283a1636933",
  "name": {
   "zh": "视频分割 · SAM 3",
   "en": "Video Segmentation · SAM 3"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "SAM 3 是可提示分割的统一基础模型，画面和视频都管：用文字，或点、框、遮罩这类视觉提示，检出、分割并跟住物体。这张卡按文字提示（如 person、car）跟满整段镜头，交付一个多层 EXR：所有物体合在一起的遮罩（alpha）、按物体区分的 Cryptomatte；「SAM 3 软边」默认开，再用 SDMatte 按这张遮罩逐帧精修边缘，多交付一层软边 alpha（alpha_soft）。",
   "en": "SAM 3 is a unified foundation model for promptable segmentation in images and video: with text, or visual prompts such as points, boxes and masks, it detects, segments and tracks objects. This card tracks a text prompt (such as person or car) through the whole shot and delivers a multi-layer EXR: all objects' mask (alpha), a per-object Cryptomatte and, with SAM 3 Soft Edge (on by default), SDMatte's soft edge per frame (alpha_soft)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "mask",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-04T12:00:00"
 },
